, 1897. The Sierra Blanca mountains."},{5,"Silas","Eli made his choice, son. A man pays for his choices."},{11,"Cole","Eli didn't choose a rope, Silas. We left him there."},{17,"Jack","Kid's gone soft since the bank."},{21,"Silas","Enough, Jack."},{24,"Silas","Cole. Ride down to the Miller farm. Flour, coffee, bullets."},{30,"Silas","And no trouble. You hear me? No trouble."},{35,"Jack","Say hi to the farmer for us, kid."}}},d2={t=10,sad=true,shots={s(F,v(40,14,70),v(0,8,0),10,v(30,10,55)),s(F,v(16,4,30),v(11,1.8,24),16,v(15,3.2,28)),s(F,v(9,3.5,20),v(12,3.8,22),12),s(F,v(12.5,3,25.5),v(10,1.4,24),12),s(F,v(14,5,26),v(0,10,0),10,v(20,30,50))},lines={{0.5,"","The Miller farm was on fire."},{4,"Farmer","...Mister... they came at dawn..."},{9,"Farmer","Five of 'em... masks... they took my Lily..."},{15,"Farmer","She's only nine years old... she's all I got left..."},{21,"Cole","Who? Who did this?"},{25,"Farmer","One had a scar... the others called him Jack..."},{31,"Cole","(Jack. Silas's own man.)"},{36,"Farmer","Please... bring her home... tell her Papa wasn't scared..."},{43,"Farmer","Tell her I'm sorry... about her birthday..."},{49,"","Thomas Miller died in the snow, holding a stranger's hand."},{55,"Cole","...Ma. It's happening again."}}},d3={t=11,shots={s(K,v(-75,8,10),v(-15,3,0),8,v(-68,6,6)),s(K,v(-17,5,6),v(-14,4.8,4),8),s(K,v(-15,4,-1),v(-12,3.6,-4),7),s(K,v(-62,5.6,2),v(-60,5.3,0),7,v(-63,5.6,4))},lines={{0.5,"","The tracks ended at an old trapper's cabin."},{5,"Jack","Quit your crying, girl! Your daddy ain't coming."},{11,"Lily","Papa! PAPA!"},{15,"Outlaw","Silas said keep her alive. She's worth money."},{21,"Cole","(Silas... ordered this?)"},{26,"Cole","(...No more.)"}}},d4={t=12,sad=true,tune=36,shots={s(K,v(-13,4.2,-1),v(-12,3.4,-4),12),s(K,v(-12.5,3.8,-6.5),v(-15,3.8,-4),18,v(-13,3.6,-6)),s(K,v(-9,5,-1),v(-13.5,3.6,-4),14,v(-9.5,4,-2)),s(K,v(-13,3.4,-1.5),v(-12,3.2,-4),14),s(K,v(-30,18,10),v(-13,3,-4),14,v(-40,28,18))},lines={{0.5,"Lily","Don't hurt me! Please don't hurt me!"},{6,"Cole","Shh... shh. I'm not gonna hurt you. I promise."},{12,"Cole","What's your name?"},{15,"Lily","...Lily."},{18,"Cole","I'm Cole. See this? It was my Pa's harmonica."},{24,"Cole","My Ma used to say... when you're scared, you play a song."},{30,"Cole","And the fear has to wait outside until it's over."},{36,"","♪ ... ♪"},{44,"Lily","Where's my Papa? Is Papa okay?"},{50,"Cole","..."},{54,"Cole","I'm sorry, Lily. I'm so sorry."},{59,"Lily","No... no... PAPA..."},{65,"","Cole held her until the snow covered their footprints."}}},d5={t=17,shots={s(G,v(26,9,26),v(6,4,2),8,v(22,7,20)),s(G,v(8,5.3,2),v(4,5,-3),10),s(G,v(6,5.3,1),v(10,5.3,6),10),s(G,v(4,5,-8),v(10,4.5,6),8),s(G,v(30,10,40),v(4,4,0),8,v(40,16,56))},lines={{0.5,"Silas","You killed Jack."},{4,"Cole","Jack burned that farm. He killed her father."},{9,"Cole","Like somebody did to mine."},{13,"Silas","...Careful, son."},{17,"Silas","The girl stays with us. Tomorrow we take the gold train."},{23,"Silas","One last job. Then we're all free. Her too."},{29,"Cole","After the train, she goes home. Swear it."},{34,"Silas","I swear it, son."},{38,"","Silas Crow had never kept a promise in his life."}}},e1={t=8,shots={s(BL,v(-60,30,-80),v(0,2,0),9,v(-40,18,-50)),s(BL,v(-12,5,-2),v(-10,4.8,-8),9),s(BL,v(-11,5.3,-6),v(-14,5.3,-2),8)},lines={{0.5,"","Devil's Cut. The Red Canyon line."},{5,"Silas","Train stops at the logs. We take the gold car. Nobody gets hurt."},{12,"Silas","Unless they make it hard."},{16,"Cole","Nobody gets hurt, Silas. You said it."},{21,"Silas","I said it."}}},e2={t=8.5,shots={s(B,v(-30,8,20),v(-8,4,0),6),s(B,v(-12,5,2),v(-8,4.8,-3),10,v(-11,5,0)),s(B,v(-13,5,1),v(-16,5,0),5),s(B,v(-17,5.4,6),v(-20,5.3,8),4),s(B,v(-22,4,-6),v(-9,2,-3),8,v(-20,3,-8)),s(B,v(-14,5,4),v(-20,5.3,8),10),s(B,v(-19,5.3,3),v(-16,5,0),10),s(B,v(-40,12,30),v(-16,4,2),8,v(-34,8,22))},lines={{0.5,"Silas","Hands where I can see 'em! Open the car!"},{6,"Guard","Okay, okay! Don't shoot!"},{10,"Young guard","Please, mister... I got a baby girl at home... two weeks old..."},{17,"Silas","Then you should've stayed home."},{21,"Cole","Silas, NO!"},{25.3,"","*gunshot*"},{29,"Cole","...He had a daughter."},{33,"Silas","No witnesses. That's the rule. You know the rules."},{39,"Cole","You said nobody gets hurt!"},{43,"Silas","I say a lot of things, son."},{48,"Cole","I'm done, Silas. I'm done with you."},{53,"Silas","Nobody's done till I say so."},{57,"Silas","...Kill him."}}},e3={t=9,shots={s(B,v(-48,8,-22),v(-60,6,-36),7,v(-52,9,-26)),s(B,v(-24,5.4,18),v(-60,5,-36),7,v(-26,5.6,16))},lines={{0.5,"Silas","You should've stayed in that barn, boy!"},{5,"Silas","I'll be waiting with the girl!"},{9,"Cole","LILY!"}}},e4={t=16.5,sad=true,shots={s(G,v(30,12,30),v(0,3,0),8),s(G,v(4,5.4,9),v(6,5.3,4),6),s(G,v(14,4,-14),v(14,3,-10),8),s(G,v(8,5,0),v(6,5.3,4),6)},lines={{0.5,"","The camp was empty."},{4,"Cole","Lily? LILY!"},{8,"","A note was pinned to the tent with Silas's knife."},{13,"Silas","\"Come home, son. Hart Ranch. Sunset. Come alone.\""},{20,"Cole","...Home."},{24,"Deputy","Spread out! He's up here somewhere!"}}},e5={t=16.8,sad=true,shots={s(Y,v(18,10,20),v(0,1.5,0),10,v(12,6,14)),s(Y,v(-4,3.6,2),v(0,2,0),14,v(-3,3,1)),s(Y,v(2,3,6),v(-2,3.8,5),12),s(Y,v(-1,2.6,-2),v(0.5,2,1),12,v(-1.5,2.2,-1)),s(Y,v(30,20,30),v(0,1,2),12,v(50,40,50))},lines={{0.5,"Cole","Dusty? Dusty! Come on, boy, get up..."},{6,"Cole","It's just a scratch... you hear me? Just a scratch..."},{12,"","The bullet had gone deep."},{16,"Cole","No, no, no... not you too... please, not you..."},{23,"Cole","You carried me for twelve years, boy."},{29,"Cole","Through every fire... every bad thing I ever did..."},{35,"Cole","And you never once asked me why."},{41,"Cole","...Go to sleep, old friend. I've got you."},{48,"","Dusty closed his eyes."},{53,"","The snow kept falling, softly, as if the sky was crying too."}}},}_G.WRCUT=_G.WRCUT or{}for k,x in pairs(aC)do _G.WRCUT[k]=x end local function O(f,sp,aD,Z)local x=In