't you weep, don't you mourn..."},{16,"Deputy","Shut up, Ward. Save your breath for the rope."},{22,"Cole","(I left you once, Eli. Never again.)"}}},f2={t=0.5,shots={s(e,v(0,5.4,16),v(-1,5,12),10),s(e,v(-4,5.4,15),v(2,5.3,12),6),s(e,v(14,8,26),v(0,4,12),6)},lines={{0.5,"Eli","Cole? ...You came back for me?"},{5,"Eli","Silas never would've. You know that, right?"},{10,"Cole","I know. Come on. Quiet now."},{14,"Deputy","HEY! THE PRISONER! JAILBREAK!"},{18,"Eli","Well... so much for quiet."}}},f3={t=2.8,sad=true,shots={s(h,v(10,8,12),v(0,1.5,0),10,v(7,5,8)),s(h,v(-1,3,2.5),v(0,1.4,0),20,v(-0.5,2.6,2)),s(h,v(1.5,3.4,-1),v(-2.5,3.8,0),16),s(h,v(-1.2,2.4,-1.4),v(0,1.4,0.5),14),s(h,v(-3,6,-4),v(14,4.8,14),12,v(-2,5,-2)),s(h,v(10,5,8),v(-2.5,3.6,0),12),s(h,v(30,18,-10),v(0,2,0),9,v(45,30,-20))},lines={{0.5,"Cole","Eli! Eli, stay with me!"},{5,"Eli","Ha... look at us... soaked like rats..."},{10,"Eli","Cole... I gotta tell you something... before I go..."},{16,"Eli","The night your ranch burned..."},{21,"Eli","It was Silas. Silas set the fire."},{26,"Eli","Your Pa owed him money... he wanted the land... your Ma said no."},{33,"Eli","I was there, Cole. I held the torch. God forgive me."},{40,"Cole","No... no... he saved me. He raised me..."},{46,"Eli","He took you 'cause he wanted a son who'd never leave him..."},{53,"Eli","Don't become him, Cole. Promise me... don't..."},{60,"","Eli Ward died in the rain at three in the morning."},{65,"Ruth","...Step away from him, Hart."},{70,"Cole","Go ahead, Sheriff. I've got nothing left."},{76,"Ruth","Silas Crow shot my husband in '91. In the back."},{82,"Ruth","I want him more than I want you."},{87,"Ruth","Hart Ranch, you said? Sunset. I'll be on the ridge."}}},g1={t=17.6,shots={s(d,v(60,22,90),v(0,4,30),9,v(40,14,70)),s(d,v(2,5.3,34),v(0,5,26),10),s(d,v(-1.5,5.4,31),v(0,5.3,40),9),s(d,v(3,5,30),v(0,5,26),8),s(d,v(15,4,24),v(12,3.8,20),4),s(d,v(-10,3,33),v(0,4,33),7,v(-12,3,30))},lines={{0.5,"","Hart Ranch. Twelve years later."},{5,"Silas","Twelve years ago I stood right here, son."},{10,"Cole","And you burned it. With my mother inside."},{15,"Silas","...Eli. He always had a soft mouth."},{20,"Silas","Your father was weak, Cole. He'd have made you weak."},{26,"Silas","I made you strong."},{30,"Cole","You made me a killer."},{34,"Silas","I made you my SON!"},{38,"Lily","COLE!"},{41,"Silas","Draw, son. Let's finish it the way men do."}}},g2x={t=17.8,sad=true,shots={s(d,v(1.2,4.2,41),v(0.6,3.4,39.5),9,v(1,5,41.5))},lines={{0.5,"","Cole's hand closed around the revolver..."},{4,"Mother","\"Don't hate anyone, my son. Hate burns you too.\""}}},g2={t=17.9,sad=true,shots={s(d,v(1.5,5.3,36),v(0,5.3,40),9),s(d,v(0,2,37),v(0,0.5,40),4),s(d,v(2,5,30),v(0,5,26),6),s(d,v(-8,4,44),v(0,3.6,40),5),s(d,v(-46,7,76),v(0,4,26),4),s(d,v(3,3,30),v(0,1.3,26),14,v(2,2.4,28)),s(d,v(4,4.6,44),v(0,3.6,39.5),12),s(d,v(30,20,70),v(0,3,38),8,v(50,30,100))},lines={{0.5,"Cole","Ma said... hate burns you too."},{5,"Cole","I'm done burning, Silas."},{9,"","Cole Hart dropped his gun in the dirt."},{12,"Silas","Pick it up... PICK IT UP!"},{14,"","*gunshot*"},{17,"Silas","...Why didn't you..."},{19,"","*gunshot*"},{22,"Ruth","That's for Tom Callahan."},{26,"Silas","You were... the closest thing... I ever had... to a son..."},{33,"Cole","I know, Silas. That's the worst part."},{38,"","Silas Crow died where it all began."},{43,"Lily","Cole! You're bleeding! COLE!"},{48,"Cole","Hey, kid... told you... I'd come."}}},h1={t=5.8,sad=true,tune=48,shots={s(g,v(-40,10,60),v(0,5,0),10,v(-30,8,44)),s(g,v(-8,5,18),v(-14,4.8,14),6),s(g,v(3,4.5,8),v(1.5,4,6),10),s(g,v(1,3.8,6.5),v(0,3.2,2.6),12,v(1.2,3.5,5.5)),s(g,v(-1,3.2,4),v(1.5,3.6,6),12),s(g,v(4,3.6,3.4),v(0,3.2,2.6),14,v(3,3.4,3.2)),s(g,v(0,3.4,8),v(0,6,60),12,v(0,4,9)),s(g,v(20,30,50),v(0,4,3),10,v(40,60,100))},lines={{0.5,"","Sunrise. Willow Lake."},{5,"Aunt","Lily? LILY! Oh, thank God, thank God!"},{11,"Lily","Aunt May! This is Cole. He saved me."},{16,"Aunt","You need a doctor, mister. I'll ride to town—"},{21,"Cole","No time for that, ma'am. It's alright."},{26,"Cole","Lily. Come here."},{29,"Cole","Here. The harmonica. It's yours now."},{34,"Cole","Your turn to keep the fear outside."},{39,"Lily","Will you teach me? You promised."},{43,"Cole","Play me something. Anything. I'll listen."},{48,"","♪ ... ♪"},{56,"Cole","Ma... I didn't hate him. I didn't..."},{62,"Cole","Look at that sun, Lily... ain't it something..."},{70,"","Cole Hart died at sunrise, listening to a little girl play."},{77,"","He was twenty years old."}}},pz1={t=7.5,tune=52,shots={s(i,v(-30,14,-40),v(0,5,0),9,v(-20,10,-28)),s(i,v(2,7.6,-9),v(0,7.6,-5),12),s(i,v(0,6.5,-3),v(0,5.2,-2),9),s(i,v(-3,7,-8),v(30,4,-30),10,v(-2,7,-10)),s(i,v(0,7.4,-1.2),v(0,7.6,-5),10),s(i,v(10,9,-20),v(300,20,-150),12,v(14,12,-26))},lines={{0.5,"","1907."},{4,"Lily","Hi, Cole. It's me again."},{9,"Lily","I still play every morning. Just like you said."},{15,"Lily","The fear still waits outside. Every time."},{21,"Lily","Dusty's foal is all grown now... well, nearly."},{27,"Lily","He runs just like you told me Dusty used to."},{33,"Lily","They wrote you were an outlaw, Cole. A bad man."},{39,"Lily","So I wrote my own words on your stone."},{45,"","COLE HART  ·  1877 – 1897  ·  HE WAS NOT A BAD MAN."},{52,"","♪ ... ♪"}}},}_G.WRCUT=_G.WRCUT or{}for k,x in pairs(q)do _G.WRCUT[k]=x end]]></ProtectedString></Properties></Item></Item></Item>
</roblox>